---
layout: layout.njk
title: DIY Team Building | Organifanten
---

<div>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl flex-1 px-6 py-20">
    <a
      href="/resources/"
      class="text-primary mb-4 inline-block text-sm font-semibold hover:underline"
      >← Back to Resources</a
    >

    <h1>DIY Team Building</h1>
    <p class="mb-2">
      Level 12 is a year of DIY team development.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm opacity-60">
      Can your team complete all tasks up to Level 12?
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="pb-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-6">
      {% for level in level12.levels %}
        <div class="border-base-300 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border">
          <h2 class="border-base-300 border-b px-6 py-3 text-xl">
            {{ level.title }}
          </h2>
          <ol class="divide-base-200 divide-y">
            {% for task in level.tasks %}
              <li class="task">
                <button
                  class="task-title text-primary flex w-full items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-left font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80"
                  data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                >
                  <span class="text-xs opacity-40">▸</span>
                  {{ task.title }}
                </button>
                <div
                  class="task-details px-6 pb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80"
                  hidden
                >
                  {{ task.detail }}
                </div>
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Further Reading -->
  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl">Further Reading</h2>
      <p class="mb-6 text-base opacity-70">
        These lessons explain the mechanisms behind the game — how team building
        works, why the tasks are designed the way they are, and how to get the
        most out of each level.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {% for lesson in lessons %}
          <div class="border-base-300 rounded-lg border p-4">
            <a
              href="/resources/diy-team-building/{{ lesson.slug }}/"
              class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
              >Lesson {{ lesson.number }}: {{ lesson.title }}</a
            >
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm opacity-60">{{ lesson.teaser }}</p>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</div>

<script src="/assets/level-toggle.js" defer></script>
